  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"174\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"118\">Brand Name:</strong> Diel Friends<br data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"134\"><strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"147\">Category:</strong> Kids Beauty &amp; DIY Crafts</p><p data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"543\"><strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"189\">About Us:</strong><br data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"192\">Diel Friends is a Korean kids’ beauty and craft brand now available in the U.S. We offer safe, fun, and age-appropriate products like botanical peel-off nail polish, SPF cushion compacts, and DIY Decoden kits (hairbrushes, mirrors, and more). Our products are made with EWG-grade, non-toxic ingredients and designed to make self-care playful and safe.</p><p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"575\"><strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"573\">What Makes Us Different:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"767\"><li data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"638\"><p data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"638\">Made specifically for kids (non-toxic, no harsh chemicals)</p></li><li data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"693\"><p data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"693\">Combines beauty, skincare, and hands-on creativity</p></li><li data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"767\"><p data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"767\">Loved by parents and perfect for gifts, playdates, or self-expression</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"794\"><strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"792\">Affiliate Benefits:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"942\"><li data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"826\"><p data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"826\"><strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"815\">15% commission</strong> per sale</p></li><li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"857\"><p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"857\"><strong data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"855\">30-day cookie duration</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"900\"><p data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"900\">Access to promo codes and media assets</p></li><li data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"942\"><p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"942\">Free product samples for top partners</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"975\"><strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"973\">Best Products to Promote:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1093\"><li data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1015\"><p data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1015\">Judy Sun Cushion (SPF 50+ for kids)</p></li><li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1053\"><p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1053\">Botanical Water-Based Nail Polish</p></li><li data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1093\"><p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1093\">DIY Hairbrush &amp; Mirror Decoden Kits</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1216\"><strong data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1109\">Ideal For:</strong><br data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1112\">Parenting blogs, kids’ lifestyle creators, DIY/craft influencers, beauty-focused pages, and gift guides.</p><p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1266\"><strong data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1266\">Let’s grow together! Join our program today.</strong></p></div>",
